`tools/fetch-dats.sh` builds them from the sources below. The count by source:

  24  No-Intro sets, through auto-datfile-generator          (2.1)
  10  Redump sets, through MetalSlug/MAMERedump              (2.2)
   3  Redump sets, through auto-datfile-generator            (2.3)
   5  GameTDB                                                 (2.4)
   1  Switch title catalog, blawar/titledb                    (2.5)
   4  MAME: three release indexes and `arcade.idcatgz`       (2.6)
  --
  47

